@startuml
title Slice 3: 教師向け課題・配信・プロンプト管理クラス図
caption 教師/管理者が設定する学校権限、課題内容、プロンプト版、クラス別配信内容を保存するモデル

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 15
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

note "削除方針\n- Task は publicationStatus=archived と deletedAt で論理削除する\n- 課題子項目・テンプレート項目は recordStatus / templateStatus で無効化・アーカイブする\n- 配信済みデータと変更履歴は追記型で通常削除しない\n- 親の論理削除で割当・提出・評価等を連鎖物理削除しない" as SoftDeletePolicy

class User {
  + userId: Long <<PK>>
  + userType: UserType
  + loginId: String <<UK>>
  + accountStatus: AccountStatus
}

class School {
  + schoolId: Long <<PK>>
  + name: String
  + schoolStatus: SchoolStatus
}

class Classroom {
  + classroomId: Long <<PK>>
  + schoolId: Long <<FK>>
  + name: String
  + gradeName: String
  + classroomStatus: ClassroomStatus
}

class TeacherSchoolPermission {
  + teacherSchoolPermissionId: Long <<PK>>
  + teacherUserId: Long <<FK>>
  + schoolId: Long <<FK>>
  + accessStatus: PermissionStatus
  + updatedByUserId: Long <<FK>>
  + updatedAt: DateTime
}

class TeacherFeaturePermission {
  + teacherFeaturePermissionId: Long <<PK>>
  + teacherUserId: Long <<FK>>
  + featureCode: TeacherFeatureCode
  + isEnabled: Boolean
  + updatedByUserId: Long <<FK>>
  + updatedAt: DateTime
}

class Task {
  + taskId: Long <<PK>>
  + taskCode: String
  + taskRevisionCode: String <<UK>>
  + revisionNumber: Integer
  + supersedesTaskId: Long <<FK>>
  + createdByUserId: Long <<FK>>
  + updatedByUserId: Long <<FK>>
  + title: String
  + theme: String
  + difficulty: Difficulty
  + language: String
  + rubricId: Long <<FK>>
  + rubricVersion: String
  + description: Text
  + inputConstraints: Text
  + creationRules: Text
  + initialCode: LongText
  + saveStatus: SaveStatus
  + publicationStatus: PublicationStatus
  + activePromptVersionId: Long <<FK>>
  + createdAt: DateTime
  + updatedAt: DateTime
  + publishedAt: DateTime
  + deletedAt: DateTime
  + deletedByUserId: Long
}

class TaskClassAssignment {
  + taskClassAssignmentId: Long <<PK>>
  + taskId: Long <<FK>>
  + classroomId: Long <<FK>>
  + assignmentStatus: TaskAssignmentStatus
  + publishAt: DateTime
  + dueAt: DateTime
  + lateSubmissionPolicy: LateSubmissionPolicy
  + createdAt: DateTime
  + updatedAt: DateTime
}

class TaskTestCase {
  + testCaseId: Long <<PK>>
  + taskId: Long <<FK>>
  + title: String
  + testCaseInput: Text
  + testCaseOutput: Text
  + testCaseOrder: Integer
  + recordStatus: RecordStatus
}

class TaskFeature {
  + featureId: Long <<PK>>
  + taskId: Long <<FK>>
  + featureText: Text
  + sortOrder: Integer
  + recordStatus: RecordStatus
}

class TaskHint {
  + hintId: Long <<PK>>
  + taskId: Long <<FK>>
  + hintTitle: String
  + hintContent: Text
  + usageSyntax: Text
  + hintCode: LongText
  + hintOrder: Integer
  + recordStatus: RecordStatus
}

class PromptVersion {
  + promptVersionId: Long <<PK>>
  + taskId: Long <<FK>>
  + version: String
  + aiModel: String
  + commonPrompt: LongText
  + additionalEvaluationInstruction: Text
  + promptStatus: PromptStatus
  + fluctuationGenerationStatus: GenerationStatus
  + evaluationExamplesStatus: GenerationStatus
  + createdByUserId: Long <<FK>>
  + createdAt: DateTime
}

class Rubric {
  + rubricId: Long <<PK>>
  + title: String
  + version: String
  + rubricStatus: RubricStatus
}

class PromptFluctuationItem {
  + fluctuationItemId: Long <<PK>>
  + promptVersionId: Long <<FK>>
  + itemText: Text
  + teacherResolution: Text
  + resolutionStatus: ResolutionStatus
  + sortOrder: Integer
}

class EvaluationExample {
  + evaluationExampleId: Long <<PK>>
  + promptVersionId: Long <<FK>>
  + exampleInput: JSON
  + exampleOutput: JSON
  + exampleStatus: RecordStatus
  + createdAt: DateTime
}

class DistributionTemplate {
  + distributionTemplateId: Long <<PK>>
  + createdByUserId: Long <<FK>>
  + updatedByUserId: Long <<FK>>
  + templateName: String
  + rootPath: String
  + saveStatus: SaveStatus
  + templateStatus: TemplateStatus
  + overwritePolicy: OverwritePolicy
  + createdAt: DateTime
  + updatedAt: DateTime
}

class DistributionTemplateFile {
  + templateFileId: Long <<PK>>
  + distributionTemplateId: Long <<FK>>
  + path: String
  + entryType: TemplateEntryType
  + initialContent: LongText
  + entryStatus: RecordStatus
}

class Distribution {
  + distributionId: Long <<PK>>
  + distributionTemplateId: Long <<FK>>
  + executedByUserId: Long <<FK>>
  + distributionStatus: DistributionStatus
  + createdAt: DateTime
  + completedAt: DateTime
}

class DistributionTarget {
  + distributionTargetId: Long <<PK>>
  + distributionId: Long <<FK>>
  + classroomId: Long <<FK>>
  + targetStatus: ClassDistributionStatus
  + scheduledAt: DateTime
  + distributedAt: DateTime
  + executionResult: Text
}

class DistributionHistory {
  + distributionHistoryId: Long <<PK>>
  + distributionId: Long <<FK>>
  + actorUserId: Long <<FK>>
  + actionType: AuditActionType
  + changeDetail: JSON
  + executionStatus: OperationResult
  + occurredAt: DateTime
}

User "1" -- "0..*" TeacherSchoolPermission
School "1" -- "0..*" TeacherSchoolPermission
User "1" -- "0..*" TeacherFeaturePermission
School "1" -- "0..*" Classroom
User "1" -- "0..*" Task : 作成/更新
Task "1" -- "0..*" TaskClassAssignment
Task "0..1" <-- "0..*" Task : supersedes
Classroom "1" -- "0..*" TaskClassAssignment
Task "1" -- "0..*" TaskTestCase
Task "1" -- "0..*" TaskFeature
Task "1" -- "0..*" TaskHint
Task "1" -- "0..*" PromptVersion
Task "0..1" -- "0..1" PromptVersion : 現在適用版(activePromptVersionId)
Rubric "1" -- "0..*" Task
PromptVersion "1" -- "0..*" PromptFluctuationItem
PromptVersion "1" -- "0..*" EvaluationExample
DistributionTemplate "1" -- "1..*" DistributionTemplateFile
DistributionTemplate "1" -- "0..*" Distribution
Distribution "1" -- "1..*" DistributionTarget
Classroom "1" -- "0..*" DistributionTarget
Distribution "1" -- "0..*" DistributionHistory

note right of TaskClassAssignment
  課題は複数の学校/クラスに割り当てられる。
  公開日時・提出期限・期限後提出可否は
  クラス単位で保存する。
end note

note bottom of Task
  公開中の編集は既存行を上書きせず、
  同じ taskCode の新しい改訂として保存する。
  学習開始後の影響変更は新しい taskCode へ複製する。
  activePromptVersionId は課題が現在使用するプロンプト版を
  1件のみ参照する。適用済み版は直接編集せず新版を作成し、
  全体再評価の実行確定時に現在適用版を切り替える。
end note

note bottom of TeacherFeaturePermission
  機能利用可否は教師×機能コードごとに1行で保持し、
  JSONの権限配列や画面チェック状態だけにしない。
end note

note bottom of DistributionTarget
  全体配信状態とクラス別状態を別々に保持する。
  各クラスの予約日時・実配信日時も個別に保存する。
end note

@enduml
